# A target that gains hexproof before resolution stays colorless while the other target becomes blue (CR 608.2b, 702.11b).
[Bot1 Deck]
Sea Kings' Blessing
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island
Shore Up
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sea Kings' Blessing.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Shore Up.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
